Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 10:48:58 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] hwpxxx desktop: character width ratio and spacing fields
 after the paragraph alignment buttons

Same look as the line-spacing field (value box + up/down arrows). Enter applies the typed value to all seven language slots, the arrows reuse the existing 1% commands, and the box follows the caret. The full-row style-bar boundary grows from 962 to 1160 px (narrow two-row boundary 460 to 600 px) so the bar never overflows; below it the fields fold into the paragraph overflow panel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
